#: ../../source/docs/mac-install.rst:30 8aa4565de8c2468886eba3c817fa710c
msgid "Install Packages"
msgstr "安装软件包"

#: ../../source/docs/mac-install.rst:34 80fa72dadf2042228c5f4db5d8ec370d
msgid "The FTDI Driver install is not needed for OSX 10.11+"
msgstr "OSX 10.11 及更高版本无需安装 FTDI 驱动程序。"

#: ../../source/docs/mac-install.rst:36 213ecd59293141dcaf5a06655ae65374
msgid ""
"The FTDI Driver install is optional for OSX Yosemite 10.10, but some "
"users have required this install."
msgstr "OSX Yosemite 10.10 的 FTDI 驱动程序安装为可选项，但部分用户需要安装。"

#: ../../source/docs/mac-install.rst:38 af4a6ebf0af14eb68a271c9b10eff8d2
msgid ""
"Open the .dmg file to see the one additional package files that needs to "
"be installed: the **FTDI USB Serial Driver**. To install the packages, "
"they will need to be opened by control-click\\* the icon and select "
"'Open'. Full instructions for `opening a downloaded "
"<http://support.apple.com/kb/ph14370>`__ file can be found on the Apple "
"site."
msgstr ""
"打开 .dmg 文件，可以看到需要安装的一个额外软件包：**FTDI USB 串行驱动程序**。安装软件包时，需通过「control-"
"click」\\* 图标并选择「Open」来打开。有关 `打开已下载文件 "
"<http://support.apple.com/kb/ph14370>`__ 的完整说明，请参阅 Apple 官方网站。"

#: ../../source/docs/mac-install.rst:44 45c99814dcec473bbfdd2f83f9ac1fb3
msgid "\\*Control-Click is the same as 'right mouse button click'"
msgstr "\\*「Control-Click」与「鼠标右键单击」相同"

#: ../../source/docs/mac-install.rst:49 cc96e0103d8247a6ac887af17ef73546
msgid ""
"Open the **FTDI USB .dmg** file to view the two packages inside. Open the"
" package labeled \"**10_4\\_10_5\\_10_6\\_10_7**\\ \" by **control-"
"click**\\ ing on the icon and selecting **Open** from the drop-down menu."
" This will bypass the security permissions and open the package."
msgstr ""
"打开 **FTDI USB .dmg** 文件，查看其中的两个软件包。通过「control-"
"click」图标并从下拉菜单中选择「Open」来打开标有「**10_4\\_10_5\\_10_6\\_10_7**\\ "
"」的软件包，这将绕过安全权限限制并打开该软件包。"

#: ../../source/docs/mac-install.rst:57 0f271a1a99304665905d780351c30068
msgid "The driver says 10_7 and it's the correct one for OSX 10.8, 10.9 & 10.10"
msgstr "该驱动程序标注为 10_7，适用于 OSX 10.8、10.9 和 10.10。"

#: ../../source/docs/mac-install.rst:66 03fe5ca026a24402836fa83f6bd3c400
msgid "Once open, follow the installation instructions to install the package."
msgstr "打开后，按照安装说明完成软件包的安装。"

#: ../../source/docs/mac-install.rst:78 26c64372034b452a848cdbe17ea993b3
msgid "Install Application"
msgstr "安装应用程序"

#: ../../source/docs/mac-install.rst:80 7930a3f19a8d4fda871548e5e0dcf4d7
msgid "Drag the AP icon into the applications folder."
msgstr "将 AP 图标拖入应用程序文件夹。"

#: ../../source/docs/mac-install.rst:85 4834728d424049b7b6c01d9cde5f669b
msgid "Open the applications folder, and open APM Planner."
msgstr "打开应用程序文件夹，然后打开 APM Planner。"

#: ../../source/docs/mac-install.rst:93 9a93219bdf044ec9acf9ab8a3741b1b6
msgid "Select **Open** to run APM Planner. Your installation is now complete."
msgstr "选择「Open」运行 APM Planner。安装现已完成。"

